{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12389","headline":"送李兵曹赴河中 · 钱起","name":"送李兵曹赴河中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"能荷钟鼎业，不矜纨绮荣。\n侯门三事後，儒服一书生。\n昔志学文史，立身爲士英。\n骊珠难隐耀，臯鹤会长鸣。\n休命且随牒，候时常振缨。\n寒蝉思关柳，匹马向蒲城。\n秋日黯将暮，黄河如欲清。\n黎人思坐啸，知子树佳声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12389.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12389","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}